     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet HIV.D.DE90</b></p><a name=\"HIV.D.DE90\"> </a><a name=\"hcHIV.D.DE90\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profiles: <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/crmi/STU1/StructureDefinition-crmi-shareablevalueset.html\">CRMI Shareable ValueSet</a>, <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/crmi/STU1/StructureDefinition-crmi-publishablevalueset.html\">CRMI Publishable ValueSet</a>, <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/crmi/STU1/StructureDefinition-crmi-computablevalueset.html\">CRMI Computable ValueSet</a></p></div><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html\"><code>http://smart.who.int/hiv/CodeSystem/HIVConcepts</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.4.4</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE91\">HIV.D.DE91</a></td><td>ABC + 3TC + ATV/r</td><td>Regimen containing abacavir, lamivudine, and atazanavir/ritonavir</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE92\">HIV.D.DE92</a></td><td>ABC + 3TC + DTG</td><td>Regimen containing abacavir, lamivudine, and dolutegravir</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE93\">HIV.D.DE93</a></td><td>ABC + 3TC + EFV</td><td>Regimen containing abacavir, lamivudine, and efavarinez</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE94\">HIV.D.DE94</a></td><td>ABC + 3TC + LPV/r</td><td>Regimen containing abacavir, lamivudine, and lopinavir/ritonavir</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE95\">HIV.D.DE95</a></td><td>ABC + 3TC + NVP</td><td>Regimen containing abacavir, lamivudine, and nevirapine</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE96\">HIV.D.DE96</a></td><td>ABC + 3TC + RAL</td><td>Regimen containing abacavir, lamivudine, and raltegravir</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE97\">HIV.D.DE97</a></td><td>AZT + 3TC + ATV/r</td><td>Regimen containing zidovudine, lamivudine, and atazanavir/ritonavir</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE98\">HIV.D.DE98</a></td><td>AZT + 3TC + DRV/r</td><td>Regimen containing zidovudine, lamivudine, and darunavir/ritonavir</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE99\">HIV.D.DE99</a></td><td>AZT + 3TC + DTG</td><td>Regimen containing zidovudine, lamivudine, and dolutegravir</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE100\">HIV.D.DE100</a></td><td>AZT + 3TC + EFV</td><td>Regimen containing zidovudine, lamivudine, and efavirenz</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE101\">HIV.D.DE101</a></td><td>AZT + 3TC + EFV 600 mg</td><td>Regimen containing zidovudine, lamivudine, and efavirenz 600 mg</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE102\">HIV.D.DE102</a></td><td>AZT + 3TC + LPV/r</td><td>Regimen containing zidovudine, lamivudine, and lopinavir/ritonavir</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE103\">HIV.D.DE103</a></td><td>AZT + 3TC + NVP</td><td>Regimen containing zidovudine, lamivudine, and nevirapine</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#HIVConcepts-HIV.46D.46DE104\">HIV.D.DE104</a></td><td>AZT + 3TC + RAL</td><td>Regimen containing zidovudine, lamivudine, and raltegravir</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-HIVConcepts.html#H